        "id": 1441652
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-12-10T12:12:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think you should be able to override these in `zephyr/program/fpmcu/et171/Kconfig` using data from DTS.\n\nEDIT: The default should be actually set in https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/ec/zephyr/app/ec/chip/riscv/riscv-egis/Kconfig.et171;l\u003d28-36;drc\u003d4f07791ed025c75eb3f65a3638f691b87c1ffb05, but I found your comment that it\u0027s not possible to get offset of `ec-ro` node. Do you know why? Does the following work?\n```\ndefault $(dt_node_int_prop_hex,/binman/wp-ro/ec-ro,offset)\n```",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 79,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 83,
        "endChar": 30
      },
      "revId": "6ce66a26da83d62b11e9a25e5be7ce5e351230f6",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "2a20f116_cdd1e63d",
        "filename": "zephyr/program/fpmcu/et171/prj.conf",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 83,
      "author": {
        "id": 1438457
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-12-10T12:40:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It doesn\u0027t work, because `ec-ro` node [doesn\u0027t use](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/ec/zephyr/include/cros/binman.dtsi;l\u003d31) the \"cros-ec,flash-layout\" compatible string as `wp-ro` does.",
      "parentUuid": "406d5950_79420869",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 79,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 83,
        "endChar": 30
      },
